      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-17T20:57:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, so the current colorizer actually gets this case wrong?\n\nI wonder if Chrome works around it somehow? I know they have tests where the gradient stops are all mixed up, which is something that we don\u0027t support directly (Chrome sorts everything before handing it off to us).",
      "parentUuid": "b0a52aeb_048e40a9",
